  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 504.09 Posting of the Plan. Appendix D shall include, at a minimum, the telephone numbers and email addresses of all of the following individuals, entities, and local and state agencies holding official copies of the EAP:\n\n(a) The local emergency responders, including police and fire departments;\n\n(b) The regional and local dispatcher(s) for local emergency responders;\n\n(c) The local emergency management director(s);\n\n(d) The New Hampshire department of safety, division of emergency services and communications (911);\n\n(e) The New Hampshire department of environmental services, division of water, dam bureau;\n\n(f) The New Hampshire department of safety, division of state police;\n\n(g) The New Hampshire department of transportation, division of operations, transportation systems, management & operations;\n\n(h) The appropriate district office(s) of the New Hampshire department of transportation, division of operations, bureau of highway maintenance;\n\n(i) The New Hampshire department of safety, division of homeland security and emergency management; and\n\n(j) Any other person or entity included on the notification flowchart included in the EAP.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss and moved by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97 (formerly Env-Wr 506.09); ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
